   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Push branches 1 and 2 ALONE, to high order. Q_k = Exp[phi_k u] q_k, q_k monic of FIXED degree M_k, coefficients Laurent from eps^-(M_k - M_1). The exponential is kept exact and expanded by Bax, so no degree growth is imposed by hand. THE BUG that made this look inconsistent at order 3: rules accumulated at earlier orders keep the then-free symbols on their right-hand sides, and /. does not re-substitute into an RHS when a later order solves for those symbols -- so acc must be back-substituted, acc -> Join[acc /. new, new]. Unknowns are read off the equations themselves, so nothing is ever left outside the Solve list as a parameter (Solve reports {} whenever a system fails for GENERIC parameter values). *)\nClearAll[pushQ12];\npushQ12[S_, P_, μ_, N_] := Module[{Ms = Mdeg[S, P, μ], pk, fk, R, acc = {}, rep = {}, eqs, unk, sol, nlo}, pk = Ms - Ms[[1]]; nlo = -Max[pk[[1 ;; 2]]]; fk[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[Exp[I eps psi[[k]] y] (y^Ms[[k]] + Sum[y^i Sum[eps^n qd[k, n, i], {n, -pk[[k]], N}], {i, 0, Ms[[k]] - 1}])]]; R = Table[Bax[N][fk[k]], {k, 2}]; Do[eqs = DeleteCases[Expand[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R[[k]], eps, n], u], {k, 2}]] /. acc], 0]; unk = DeleteDuplicates[Select[Join[Cases[Variables[eqs], _tcn | _qd], If[n >= 1, Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}], {}], Flatten[Table[qd[k, n, i], {k, 2}, {i, 0, Ms[[k]] - 1}]]], FreeQ[If[acc === {}, {}, acc[[All, 1]]], #] &]]; sol = Quiet@Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, unk]; If[sol === {}, rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"INCONSISTENT\", \"-\"}]; Break[]]; rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"ok\", Length[Complement[unk, First[sol][[All, 1]]]]}]; acc = Join[acc /. First[sol], First[sol]], {n, nlo, N}]; <|\"M\" -> Ms, \"report\" -> rep, \"sol\" -> acc|>];\nSetState[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\nWith[{r = pushQ12[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 8]}, Column[{Row[{\"mu = {2,2,0,0}, M = \", r[\"M\"]}], Grid[Prepend[r[\"report\"], {\"order n\", \"#eqs\", \"#unk\", \"status\", \"#free\"}], Frame -> All]}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"251778\" data-output-id=\"34\" data-out-n=\"39\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[39]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"29\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.24em;vertical-align:-6.37em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.87em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.32em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.29em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mu = {2,2,0,0}, M = </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.67em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.29em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.29em;\"><sp