  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The DUAL side. On the unimodular ray Prod_{i != j} z_i = 1/z_j, so Q^j = Exp[-phi_j u] q^j with deg q^j = mu_j -- the mirror of the Q_k side, with mu_j in place of M_k and the shifts reversed. BaxD is the dual Baxter operator (nu_4 in place of nu_1, tau_a shifted by +a h), cleared of denominators. For the vacuum mu = {2,2,0,0} the two lowest duals are j = 3,4 with mu = 0, i.e. pure exponentials, exactly as Q_1, Q_2 were. The checks against the exact tau are in the cells below. *)\nClearAll[BaxD, pushQ34];\nBaxD[n_][f_] := Normal[Series[Expand[(((Product[ν[SS, PP][4][u + m h], {m, 1, 4}] f[u] - τ[1][SS, PP, MU][u + h] Product[ν[SS, PP][4][u + m h], {m, 2, 4}] f[u + h] + τ[2][SS, PP, MU][u + 2 h] Product[ν[SS, PP][4][u + m h], {m, 3, 4}] f[u + 2 h] - τ[3][SS, PP, MU][u + 3 h] ν[SS, PP][4][u + 4 h] f[u + 3 h] + τ[4][SS, PP, MU][u + 4 h] f[u + 4 h]) /. prm) /. zSub[n + 4]) /. tcSer[n]], {eps, 0, n}]];\npushQ34[S_, P_, μ_, N_] := Module[{ds = μ[[{4, 3}]], js = {4, 3}, pk, fk, R, acc = {}, rep = {}, eqs, unk, sol, nlo}, pk = ds - ds[[1]]; nlo = -Max[pk]; fk[a_] := Function[y, Evaluate[Exp[-I eps psi[[js[[a]]]] y] (y^ds[[a]] + Sum[y^i Sum[eps^n qe[a, n, i], {n, -pk[[a]], N}], {i, 0, ds[[a]] - 1}])]]; R = Table[BaxD[N][fk[a]], {a, 2}]; Do[eqs = DeleteCases[Expand[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R[[a]], eps, n], u], {a, 2}]] /. acc], 0]; unk = DeleteDuplicates[Select[Join[Cases[Variables[eqs], _tcn | _qe], If[n >= 1, Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}], {}], Flatten[Table[qe[a, n, i], {a, 2}, {i, 0, ds[[a]] - 1}]]], FreeQ[If[acc === {}, {}, acc[[All, 1]]], #] &]]; sol = Quiet@Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, unk]; If[sol === {}, rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"INCONSISTENT\", \"-\"}]; Break[]]; rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"ok\", Length[Complement[unk, First[sol][[All, 1]]]]}]; acc = Join[acc /. First[sol], First[sol]], {n, nlo, N}]; <|\"deg\" -> ds, \"report\" -> rep, \"sol\" -> acc|>];\n\"dual side loaded: BaxD, pushQ34\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"251778\" data-output-id=\"35\" data-out-n=\"43\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[43]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"29\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7ZHVhbCBzaWRlIGxvYWRlZDogQmF4RCwgcHVzaFEzNH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dual side loaded: BaxD, pushQ34</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
