  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Independent benchmark: the EXACT pseudovacuum transfer matrix, tau_a(u) = Sum_{|I|=a} z_I Prod_m nu_{i_m}(u - (a-m) h). NB the first index carries the LARGEST shift; the other convention does not match the ansatz. Matching it to the five-tc ansatz gives tc exactly in the z, and expanding on the ray gives tau to all orders -- the yardstick for everything below. *)\nClearAll[tauVac, tcExactVac, tcEx, tcExN, subEx];\ntauVac[a_][S_, P_][y_] := Total[(Times @@ (z /@ #) Product[ν[S, P][#[[m]]][y - (a - m) h], {m, a}]) & /@ Subsets[Range[4], {a}]];\ntcExactVac[S_, P_, μ_] := Module[{x, eqs}, eqs = Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Expand[τ[a][S, P, μ][x] - tauVac[a][S, P][x]], x], {a, 4}]]; Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, tcvars]];\ntcEx = Simplify[(tcvars /. First[tcExactVac[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}]]) /. prm];\ntcExN = Table[Normal[Series[tcEx[[i]] /. Table[z[j] -> Exp[I eps psi[[j]]], {j, 4}], {eps, 0, 8}]], {i, 5}];\nsubEx = Flatten[Table[tcn[i, m] -> SeriesCoefficient[tcExN[[i]], {eps, 0, m}], {i, 5}, {m, 8}]];\nSetState[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\n{\"ansatz represents the exact tau\" -> (tcExactVac[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}] =!= {}), \"exact tc at eps^0 == untwisted tc0\" -> (Simplify[Table[SeriesCoefficient[tcExN[[i]], {eps, 0, 0}], {i, 5}] - UntwSolve[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][\"tc0\"]] === {0, 0, 0, 0, 0}), \"exact tc at eps^1\" -> Table[SeriesCoefficient[tcExN[[i]], {eps, 0, 1}], {i, 5}], \"Bax kills Exp[phi_k u] for k=1,2 to order 8\" -> Table[Simplify[Expand[Bax[8][Function[y, Exp[I eps psi[[k]] y]]] /. subEx]] === 0, {k, 4}], \"BaxD kills Exp[-phi_j u] for j=3,4 to order 8\" -> Table[Simplify[Expand[BaxD[8][Function[y, Exp[-I eps psi[[j]] y]]] /. subEx]] === 0, {j, 4}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"251778\" data-output-id=\"36\" data-out-n=\"51\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[51]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"29\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:11.7em;vertical-align:-5.6em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.49em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ansatz represents the exact tau</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exact tc at eps</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">0 == untwisted tc0</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.1em;\"><span class=\"pstr