   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* MAIN RESULT. Push the two direct branches, and separately the two dual branches, to order N, and count how much of tau each side fixes at each order. Both fix all five tc at orders 1..N-1 and agree with the exact tau; only the top order lags. *)\nSetState[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\nrv = pushQ12[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 8];\nrd = pushQ34[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 8];\nfixedTab[r_] := Table[With[{v = Table[tcn[i, m] /. r[\"sol\"], {i, 5}]}, {m, Count[v, _?(FreeQ[#, _tcn] &)], DeleteDuplicates[Cases[v, _tcn, Infinity]]}], {m, 8}];\nmatchEx[r_] := Simplify[Flatten[Table[(tcn[i, m] /. r[\"sol\"]) - (tcn[i, m] /. subEx), {m, 7}, {i, 5}]]] === ConstantArray[0, 35];\nColumn[{Row[{\"direct branches Q_1, Q_2 : M = \", rv[\"M\"]}], Grid[Prepend[rv[\"report\"], {\"order n\", \"#eqs\", \"#unk\", \"status\", \"#free at this order\"}], Frame -> All], Grid[Prepend[fixedTab[rv], {\"order m\", \"#tc fixed (of 5)\", \"remaining free\"}], Frame -> All], Row[{\"matches exact tau, orders 1-7: \", matchEx[rv]}], Row[{\"dual branches Q^4, Q^3 : deg q^j = mu_j = \", rd[\"deg\"]}], Grid[Prepend[rd[\"report\"], {\"order n\", \"#eqs\", \"#unk\", \"status\", \"#free at this order\"}], Frame -> All], Grid[Prepend[fixedTab[rd], {\"order m\", \"#tc fixed (of 5)\", \"remaining free\"}], Frame -> All], Row[{\"matches exact tau, orders 1-7: \", matchEx[rd]}]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
